[Options]

[A.]
<h2>First Wave</h2> 
<i>"It is easier to defend than to attack!"<br> 
--Unknown</i>

<p>The attack has begun, the High command of thunder has sent a wave of Thunder Minions to weaken your defence, Dont let it happen!
Every island in your clan is in battle, make this battle end as quickly as possible as the High commanders themselves are not far behind!


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Congratulations! </h2> 
<p>The Minions are dead, the rest of your clan report victory, now prepare for the final battle, the battle with the Thunder commanders!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Thunder_Command

